{
  "bookId": "hero-212110",
  "id": "bond-41103",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41103001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "差不多可以睁眼了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还差一点。嗯……这个角度很完美，可以睁眼了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "这是……学校？除了教学楼，棒球场也有……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "哦，这不是学校的食堂吗？还摆上了咖喱饭的模型。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我可是仔细调查过资料的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "嗯，不愧是「little busters」的成员，就该这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "教室和走廊也是熟悉得令人安心啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "41103009",
              "text": "恭介能喜欢真是太好了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "41103009",
              "text": "多谢夸奖，恭介。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "41103008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "来到这里以后，每天都有许多有趣的事情，甚至让我有种在梦中世界的感觉啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "「有趣」对我们来说已经是「日常」了，这就是现实啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "因为有恭介和「little busters」的大家在，有趣的任务总是没停过呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "哈哈哈，果然「little busters」就是最棒的！现在就让我布置mission吧——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "新的任务吗？真是令人期待。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "「让我们在这里开启新的日常」，那么，mission start——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41103015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "耶——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
